
"""
REAL-TIME FINANCIAL NEWS PRODUCER
=================================

Sources:
1. Business Standard
2. Moneycontrol
3. CNBC-TV18
4. Mint

Requirements:
- Collect only news mentioning the 15 target companies.
- Initial baseline collection on startup.
- Refresh every 15 minutes.
- RSS only. No article webpage scraping.
- Preserve original RSS information.
- Publish matching records to Kafka.
- Buffer failed Kafka messages locally.
- No deduplication.
"""

